        "category": "Beast Ability",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The creature represents a group of smaller creatures, such as a swarm of spiders or a school of fish. The swarm can occupy another creature's space and vice versa, and the swarm can move through any opening large enough for a single member of its swarm. The swarm can't regain hit points or gain temporary hit points. The creature's size is increased one step (do not adjust its attributes).</p>"
